  "description": "\"Dokebi Cafe: Sacred Grounds for Those Who Wait!\" \n\nGang-Eun has a recurring dream, in which she dies in the arms of a man on a battlefield. Somehow, misfortune seems to surround her when she has that dream.\n\nOne day, the Dokebi king opens a cafe in the neighborhood. Soon, the word gets out that people mysteriously meet lost relationships at the cafe. Gang-Eun starts working at that strange cafe and gets involved in various lost relationships. Then, she realizes that the man in her dream may be a lost relationship from her previous life...\n\n(Source: NetComics)",
